/T (The client is advised to maintain regular backups of application data.  Source code ownership shall remain with SG Softech unless otherwise agreed in writing.  The client shall be responsible for providing accurate business information, product data and other required content.  Any major change in infrastructure requirements due to substantial growth in users, pharmacies, orders, database size, storage or traffic may result in additional hosting charges.  The Centralized Backend shall not include a separate UI or standalone web-based administration dashboard. Administrative and operational functions included within the agreed scope shall be provided through the Inventory & Warehouse Management Solution The client/admin user shall not require remote access to the hosting server for normal day-to-day business operations. Server-level access shall remain restricted to authorized technical personnel.  All disputes shall be subject to Jamshedpur, Jharkhand Jurisdiction Only. )
/E (The client is advised to maintain regular backups of application data.  Source code ownership shall remain with SG Softech unless otherwise agreed in writing.  The client shall be responsible for providing accurate business information, product data and other required content.  Any major change in infrastructure requirements due to substantial growth in users, pharmacies, orders, database size, storage or traffic may result in additional hosting charges.  The Centralized Backend shall not include a separate UI or standalone web-based administration dashboard. Administrative and operational functions included within the agreed scope shall be provided through the Inventory & Warehouse Management Solution The client/admin user shall not require remote access to the hosting server for normal day-to-day business operations. Server-level access shall remain restricted to authorized technical personnel.  All disputes shall be subject to Jamshedpur, Jharkhand Jurisdiction Only. )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [6]
>>
